From: Ubuntu Desktop bug work
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: ding: do not clear an already-cleared desktop window

disable() and the MetaWindow "unmanaged" handler can both call
_clearWindow() for the same window (lock screen / extension disable).
The second call dereferenced a null customJS_ding. Make _clearWindow
idempotent and skip refresh on windows that already dropped their
emulator.

Forwarded: no
---
